Not a store: a finding against the producer. A specification whose own
input is named t0 (or t1, t3...) collided with the fresh names the
producer's inliner minted for callee steps, yielding an invalid machine
(SSA caught the redefinition, so no wrong answer was ever certified) --
but a producer that fails on legal specs is a bug. Fixed: the producer
picks a prefix no name in the spec or its callees starts with
(wproducer._Fresh). Regression: tests/test_blake3_slice.py CallTest.
